{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104264","id":2396970178,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6O3tzC","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104264/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104264/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/057858a0fb703b7f314fe3fbff85a1abda92595d","number":104264,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize gdvirtual function layout","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"While inspecting memory layout of `Node`, I notice that it has a lot of gdvirtual functions generated by `GDVIRTUAL*` macros with suboptimal layout. It has a `bool` flag in the middle with 7 bytes padding. `Node` has 10 gdvirtual methods, so the total padding size is 70 bytes, contributing 6.5% to the size of `Node`. I think it should be good to eliminate this waste.\r\n\r\nThe idea is, a gdvirtual function currently has 3 state:\r\n- pre-initialized: `initialized == false`, `ptr == nullptr`\r\n- initialized: `initialized == true`, `ptr != nullptr`\r\n- invalid: `initialized == true`, `ptr == nullptr`\r\n\r\nWe can represent them with one single pointer with an invalid pointer value (I choose `(uintptr_t)-1` here):\r\n- pre-initialized: `ptr == nullptr`\r\n- initialized: `ptr != nullptr && ptr != (void *)(uintptr_t)-1`\r\n- invalid: `ptr == (void *)(uintptr_t)-1`\r\n\r\nI ran some quick regression test to ensure gdvirtual call performance is not affected.\r\nTest project: [test_virtual_call.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19281191/test_virtual_call.zip)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"no